<title>USA: Lehman wins Florida $190 mln Board of Education.</title>
<headline>Lehman wins Florida $190 mln Board of Education.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it won $190 million of State of Florida full faith and credit State Board of Education capital outlay bonds, 1997 Series A, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.077 percent.</p>
</text>
